{"id":33797,"slug":"afire","title":"Afire","year":2023,"country":"Germany","duration":102,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/33797-afire","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/af6d7054a863a549df3e4dc25b5d2ea0/6OsoKuduwPtczeOschTApDcQVmYJuy_large.jpg","description":"While vacationing by the Baltic Sea, writer Leon (Thomas Schubert) and photographer Felix (Langston Uibel) are surprised to encounter Nadja (Paula Beer), a mysterious young woman staying as a guest at the holiday home of Felix’s family. Nadja soon distracts Leon from finishing his latest novel, not only because of her passionate liaison with lifeguard Devid (Enno Trebs) but also because her brutal honesty forces Leon to confront his artistic inadequacies. As Nadja and Leon grow closer, an encroaching forest fire threatens the group and pushes the writer to discover whether he can truly care for anything beyond himself. Christian Petzold’s acclaimed latest film was the winner of the Silver Bear Grand Jury Prize at the 2023 Berlin International Film Festival.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Christian Petzold","slug":"christian-petzold"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Thomas Schubert","role":"Leon","slug":"thomas-schubert"},{"actor":"Paula Beer","role":"Nadja","slug":"paula-beer"},{"actor":"Langston Uibel","role":"Felix","slug":"langston-uibel"},{"actor":"Enno Trebs","role":"Devid","slug":"enno-trebs"},{"actor":"Matthias Brandt","role":"Helmut","slug":"matthias-brandt"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Christian Petzold","slug":"christian-petzold"},{"role":"Writer","person":"Christian Petzold","slug":"christian-petzold"},{"role":"Director of photography","person":"Hans Fromm","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Florian Koerner von Gustorf","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Michael Weber","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Anton Kaiser","slug":null},{"role":"Editor","person":"Bettina Böhler","slug":null},{"role":"Production design","person